log.info "=== All mock tests passed ==="
```

**Mock Service Summary:**

| Feature | Implemented | Notes |
|---------|-------------|-------|
| **Products API** | ✓ | Filtering, single product |
| **Cart API** | ✓ | Create, retrieve, expire |
| **Orders API** | ✓ | Create from cart, retrieve |
